flowchart TD
    A[Student Grade 12 or 13] --> B[Register and verify]
    B --> C[Select Bio or Maths stream and subjects]
    C --> D[Student dashboard]
    D --> E[Find approved teacher and class]
    E --> F{Free demo available?}
    F -- Yes --> G{Watch or skip?}
    F -- No --> H[Choose available class batch]
    G -- Watch --> I[View approved demo]
    G -- Skip --> H
    I --> H
    H --> J[Checkout and verified payment]
    J --> K[Enrollment and entitlement]
    K --> L[Authorized live class and resources]
    D --> M[XACT practice or custom mock]
    M --> N[Server-owned attempt and scoring]
    N --> O[Result and approved explanations]
    T[Approved teacher] --> P[Create classes and optional demos]
    P --> Q[Reviewer approval]
    Q --> E
    T --> R[Build versioned XACT paper]
    R --> S[Assign authorized students]
    S --> N
    X[Admin and academic / finance reviewers] --> Q
    X --> Y[Review refunds, content and safety]
    Y --> Z[Audited decisions and notifications]
